              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जमाना (jamānā) is a tadbhava, inherited from Sanskrit yamyatē, \"is held, is fixed\" (CDIAL 10428). CDIAL lists jamānā, \"to collect\", beside the intransitive jamnā."
